g what B previously stated, presupposing B identified the event as a 食事会.","evidence_level":"E2","evidence":[{"turn_id":12,"quote":"食事会が延期になってしまったのですね。"}]},{"candidate_id":"c7","verdict":"supported","reason":"Turn 13 '数人だと、全員の予定を合わせるのが難しそうです' presupposes that the gathering involves several people (数人). A is commenting on the difficulty of coordinating schedules among a small group, which entails B mentioned multiple participants.","evidence_level":"E2","evidence":[{"turn_id":13,"quote":"数人だと、全員の予定を合わせるのが難しそうです。"}]},{"candidate_id":"c8","verdict":"supported","reason":"Turn 10 '大分先ですね。今より寒くなってそうです' presupposes the new date is far in the future. Turn 14 '延期になりましたがなんとか予定が合ってよかったですね' confirms the rescheduled date was eventually agreed upon. Together these entail both that the date is far ahead and that it was successfully confirmed.","evidence_level":"E2","evidence":[{"turn_id":10,"quote":"大分先ですね。今より寒くなってそうです。"},{"turn_id":14,"quote":"延期になりましたがなんとか予定が合ってよかったですね。"}]}]}
